  meditation=["Minute 1: sit comfortably and let the breath settle.","Minute 2: picture a grove of green trees, and in its middle a large lotus, open and shining.","Minute 3: see the Mother seated there, golden and at ease, a golden lotus in her hand. Stay with the picture without asking for anything.","Minute 4: say Lakṣmīm praṇamāmi, “I bow to Lakshmi”, and let the picture fade."],
